@startuml

title Smart Campus - Book Room Activity Diagram

start

:Select room and time slot;
:Submit booking request;

if (Is the time range valid?) then ([valid])
else ([invalid])
    :Reject booking\nInvalid time range;
    stop
endif

if (Is the room blocked?) then ([yes])
    :Reject booking\nRoom is blocked;
    stop
else ([no])
endif

if (Does the request overlap\nan active booking?) then ([yes])
    :Reject booking\nTime slot overlaps;
    stop
else ([no])
endif

:Create booking;
:Send confirmation;

stop

note right
R1:
- Start must be in the future
- Duration > 0
- Duration <= 2 hours
end note

@enduml